  {
   "id": "the-awakener-forgotten-oath-263734@3.0",
   "gameId": "the-awakener-forgotten-oath-263734",
   "displayName": "Patch 3.0",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-11-07T08:24:56.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Version 3.0 is here! This major update introduces two new characters, a new weapon class, charge mechanics, and a wide range of system optimizations and content additions. Step once more into the fractured fate.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Major New Features",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44538281/dedf25836c8474babbc1f9b5b360e85930bde964.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. New Playable Character: Tierdagon – The Warrior",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A heavily armored warrior with high defense and powerful charge-based bursts. He serves as both shield and hammer for the team.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. New Playable Character: Caelynn – The Elven Blade",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A swift and agile greatsword warrior capable of rapid combos and charged attacks, ideal for skilled players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. New Class Mechanic: Charge Attack System",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new \"Charge Attack\" mechanic allows certain skills from the new characters to be held and released, increasing power or altering behavior.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. New Weapon Type: Greatsword",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A powerful, slow-striking two-handed weapon exclusive to the Warrior class.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. New Weapon Additions: Five Warrior-Exclusive Greatswords",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "·Oath Breaker",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "·King’s Blade",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "·Knight’s Will",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "·Wrath of Elves",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "·Golden Oath",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. New Weapon System: Weapon Bonuses",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Each greatsword comes with unique attribute bonuses and can be used immediately upon unlock.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. New Feature: Skin System Launched",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Characters can now equip cosmetic skins. Caelynn receives three alternate outfits:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "·Verdant Oath (default skin)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "·Pale Chapter",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "·Flame of Dusk",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "·Tideborne Blue",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44538281/bed955753613b857c483611a98c591b1a819ef9d.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "8. Class Skill System Optimization: Elemental Effects from Level 2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "All class skills now receive elemental enhancements starting at Level 2 (previously Level 4).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "9. Relic Expansion: 12 Elemental Relics Return",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Twelve elemental relics from version 1.0 have now returned.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "10. New Dialogue Content Implemented",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tierdagon and Caelynn now feature multiple dialogue sequences, including story interactions and pre-battle lines.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "11. New Shop Feature: Same-Type Discount",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "12. New Language Support: Japanese Subtitles Added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Japanese subtitles are now available, supporting a wider range of players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🛠️ Fixes & Performance Optimizations",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed incorrect HP config for Lizardman Pillager (16000 → 4000)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issue where selected lobby skills were replaced with default skills in-game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bug where Combat Arts could not be purchased in the shop",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bug where Combat Arts were reset after boss fights",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed crash issues triggered by certain AOE skills",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Normal attack optimization: final hits no longer force stagger, instead generate higher Break value",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced Break value of Orc Bonecrusher and Dreadknight",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
